# mktexfmt

> Create a TeX format or Metafont base.
> More information: <https://manned.org/fmtutil-sys>.

- Create a format:

`mktexfmt {{format}}`

- Display help:

`mktexfmt --help`

- Display version:

`mktexfmt --version`
